OL,3,GNEWSATeenage boy dies in crash
OL,4,Afollowing police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has died in a crash
OL,7,Ffollowing a police pursuit.
OL,9,FThe crash happened in south Bristol on
OL,10,Fthe A37 Wells Road at its junction with
OL,11,FAirport Road and Wootton Park just
OL,12,Fafter 04:00 on Sunday.
OL,14,FAvon and Somerset Police said the crash
OL,15,Finvolved a white Nissan Juke and a
OL,16,Fblack Audi S3 being driven by members
OL,17,Fof the public. The force said it
OL,18,Ffollowed a short police pursuit
OL,19,Finvolving an unmarked police vehicle
OL,20,Fand the white Nissan Juke.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
