OL,3,GNEWSATeenage boy dies in crash
OL,4,Afollowing police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy, who was a passenger in
OL,7,Fthe white Nissan Juke, died at the
OL,8,Fscene. Officers later arrested a
OL,9,F17-year-old boy at a residential
OL,10,Fproperty on suspicion of causing death
OL,11,Fby dangerous driving. He remains in
OL,12,Fpolice custody.
